      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 0,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "I would be behold, should you lend your might!\r\nNone but you can stand against a\r\nfiend of such power!",
        "Jp" : "ありがたい、力を貸してくれるか！\r\nあの強大な魔族に太刀打ちできるのは\r\n貴君をおいて他にはいない"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 516426,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 1,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "The Fiends that have appeared in endless numbers\r\nuntil now — 'twas likely the Scourge that\r\nsummoned them. If so, then slaying the Scourge\r\nshould see Kingal freed from peril.",
        "Jp" : "今まで無尽蔵に現れていた魔族は\r\n恐らくスカージが呼び寄せていたもの――\r\nとなれば、スカージを討てば\r\nこのキンガルも危機を脱するはずだ"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 552688,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 2,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "I entrust to you the extermination of the Scourge\r\nlurking in <SPOT 916> — nay, I\r\ncommend the fate of this Kingal\r\nCanyon entire to you.",
        "Jp" : "貴君に《<SPOT 916>》に潜む\r\nスカージの討伐――\r\nいや、このキンガル峡谷の命運を託そう"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 552691,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 3,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "Come to think of it, Adelin was terribly worried\r\nabout you. Do show your face afore your departure.",
        "Jp" : "――そういえば、アデリンが\r\n貴君のことをずいぶん心配していたようだ\r\n出発前に顔を見せてやってくれ"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 552806,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    } ],
