  }, {
    "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgGroup",
    "GroupNameSerial" : 0,
    "GroupSerial" : 19359,
    "GroupType" : 0,
    "GroupTypeName" : "MSG_GROUP_TYPE_NONE",
    "MsgData" : [ {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 11,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "That you have returned thus means you have\r\nvanquished that mighty fiend, the Scourge.",
        "Jp" : "貴君がこうして戻ったということは\r\nかの強大な悪魔\"スカージ\"を\r\n破ってきてくれたのだな"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 516430,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 12,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "'Tis aught you know well, I trust — that in\r\nthis village, 'twas believed a fell hex\r\nwould betide any who entered the ruins.",
        "Jp" : "この村では、遺跡に入ると恐ろしい呪いが\r\n降りかかると信じられていたのは\r\n貴君も知るところだろう"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 552845,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 13,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "By venturing into the ruins and vanquishing the\r\nmighty fiend, you have shattered, too, the \"hex\r\nthat lay upon our hearts.\"",
        "Jp" : "遺跡に入り、強大な魔族を打ち破ることで\r\n貴君は\"我々の心にかかった呪い\"をも\r\n見事打ち破ってくれたのだ"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 552846,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 14,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "'Tis not yet clearly manifest, but this change\r\nwill soon seep into the villagers as well.",
        "Jp" : "今はまだはっきりとは表れていないが\r\nこの変化はじきに村人たちにも\r\n染み込んでいくことだろう"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 552847,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 15,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "As Area Master of Kingal Canyon,\r\nand as chief of this Glyndwr,\r\nI offer you my utmost gratitude—",
        "Jp" : "キンガル峡谷のエリアマスターとして\r\nそしてこのグリンデュアの族長として\r\n貴君に最大限の感謝を――"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 552848,
      "MsgType" : 0,
